# load_board.func

> Module: load_board (Yük Panosu) | Category: FLEET

## Purpose
Cross-tenant freight marketplace. Companies post available loads (YUK_VAR — I have cargo) or search for loads (YUK_ARA — I need cargo). Enables B2B matching between shippers and carriers within the Unysol platform. Added in v2.34.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish trucking companies struggle to find return loads (backhaul)
- Empty return trips waste fuel and revenue potential
- No centralized marketplace for small/medium Turkish logistics firms
- Real-time load matching reduces deadhead miles
- WhatsApp sharing enables viral distribution of load postings

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `load_board`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Posting tenant |
| yuk_tipi | VARCHAR(20) | YUK_VAR (have load) / YUK_ARA (need load) |
| sehir | VARCHAR(100) | City |
| ilce | VARCHAR(100) | District |
| yuk_aciklamasi | TEXT | Cargo description |
| yuk_miktari | VARCHAR(100) | Cargo quantity/weight |
| teslim_tarihi | DATE | Delivery deadline |
| iletisim | VARCHAR(100) | Contact info |
| aktif | BOOLEAN | Active listing |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Cross-tenant visible** — loads from ALL tenants are visible (marketplace model).

## User Interface
**LoadBoardPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/load-board`
- DataGrid table: Tip, Şehir, İlçe, Yük Açıklaması, Miktar, Teslim, İletişim
- Filter tabs: Tümü / Yük Var / Yük Ara
- "İlgileniyorum" button per row → POST interest notification
- WhatsApp share button per listing
- Add modal: type (var/ara), city dropdown, district, description, quantity, date, contact
- Stats summary at top

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/load-board/` | Tenant JWT | List all loads (cross-tenant) |
| POST | `/api/tenant/load-board/` | Tenant JWT | Post new load |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/load-board/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit load |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/load-board/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove load |
| POST | `/api/tenant/load-board/{id}/interest` | Tenant JWT | Express interest |
| GET | `/api/tenant/load-board/stats` | Tenant JWT | Statistics |
| GET | `/api/cities` | Public | City list for dropdowns |

